SUMMARY:Saturday Live Music at Spicy Vines feat. S.R. Laws
DESCRIPTION:Where unforgettable wines\, live music\, and good vibes come together. \nJoin us every Saturday from 3–6 PM at Spicy Vines for a tasting room experience like no other — where top local musicians from across the Bay Area meet our award-winning small-lot wines. From Rock & Roll and Blues to Jazz\, Bluegrass\, and Americana\, each weekend brings new sounds and new reasons to raise a glass. \nS.R. Laws\nRooted in Northern California and shaped by a lifetime of musical discovery\, singer-songwriter\, S.R. Laws\, crafts heartfelt songs with slow-burning passion and vivid storytelling. Now based in Sonoma County\, he tours and performs original rock with his band\, The Heartsleeves\, drawing listeners in with melodies inspired by legends like John Hiatt\, Rodney Crowell\, and Neil Finn. \nDetails\nNo cover. Walk-ins are welcome\, but this event tends to fill up quickly\, so we recommend making a reservation. We are dog and family friendly!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/saturday-live-music-at-spicy-vines-feat-s-r-laws-2/
LOCATION:Spicy Vines\, 441 Healdsburg Ave.\, Healdsburg\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
END:VEVENT
