SUMMARY:Fancy Farmraiser Benefit & Auction at Charlie's Acres
DESCRIPTION:This 10th anniversary celebration will be bigger\, brighter\, and more impactful than ever! \nGet ready for a night of wonder in support of rescued farmed animals on Saturday\, September 19\, 2026 from 4:00 pm – 8:30 pm at Charlie’s Acres Farm Animal Sanctuary in Sonoma\, California. Set in the heart of Wine Country at our serene sanctuary\, this event is a vital fundraiser that sustains the ongoing mission-driven work of Charlie’s Acres. Your attendance directly supports the lifetime care of our animal residents\, emergency response\, and humane education programs. \nWhat Awaits You:\n-Meet the rescued animal residents of Charlie’s Acres while you enjoy cocktails from Humboldt Distillery\, local wine from Etude and Moon Hollow (Moon Mountain District)\, and live music in our picnic area.\n-Take a tethered hot air balloon ride with Sonoma Ballooning and enjoy views of the sanctuary and surrounding area from 40–60 feet above the ground.*\n-Hop aboard the Sonoma Valley Wine Trolley and explore the sanctuary with a special stop to treat our resident cows to fresh hay.\n-Savor a thoughtfully prepared plant-based dinner that highlights the abundance of our local farms by our friends at Nova Terra Kitchen & Creamery.\n-Bid on exclusive experiences\, unique items\, and one-of-a-kind packages.\n-An insight into the sanctuary’s mission directly from the passionate individuals behind our work. \n*Tethered hot air balloon rides are dependent on day-of weather conditions. \nYour support transforms lives\, offering a future filled with hope and kindness for both humans and animals. We look forward to sharing this evening with you. \nTickets available at FancyFarmraiser.com
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/fancy-farmraiser-benefit-auction-at-charlies-acres/
LOCATION:Charlie’s Acres Farm Animal Sanctuary\, 3201 Napa Rd\, Sonoma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Other
END:VEVENT
