SUMMARY:Jack London Park Partners Gala:  Jack's 150th - A Big Wish
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Jack London’s 150th birthday with an evening inspired by his bold spirit\, big ideas\, and enduring love of this land.\nJoin friends for a jubilant night of food\, wine\, music\, and joy at the Park where legacy meets celebration and the story continues to unfold. We’ll toast to Jack’s extraordinary life\, reflect on the dream he left behind\, and dance into what comes next.\nIt’s a birthday. It’s a milestone. It’s a bold wish.\n• When: Saturday\, September 19\, 2026 from 5:00-9:00\n• Where: Jack London State Historic Park – Eucalyptus Grove and Winery Ruins\n• What to expect: Delicious appetizers and dinner catered by Park Avenue\, amazing wine from Lasseter Family Winery\, beautiful views\, live music\, and a great time!\nAll proceeds benefit Jack London Park Partners\, a 501(c)3 non-profit organization.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/jack-london-park-partners-gala-jacks-150th-a-big-wish/
LOCATION:Jack London State Historic Park\, 2400 London Ranch Rd.\, Glen Ellen\, CA
CATEGORIES:Other
END:VEVENT
